  +#10'  Result:=StrToInt(HexStr);'#13#10'end;'#13#10#13#10'{'#13#10'  We turn '
  +'off implicit exceptions, since these routines are tested, and it '#13#10'  '
  +'saves 20% codesize (and some speed) and don''t throw exceptions, except may'
