  +'*************'#13#10#13#10'Abstract:'#13#10'  Write and read a precompiled '
  +'module (pcu, gzipped json).'#13#10#13#10'- Built-In symbols are collected i'
  +'n one array.'#13#10'- symbols of this module are stored in a tree'#13#10'- '
  +'external references are stored in used module trees. They can refer'#13#10
  +'  recursively to other external references, so they are collected in a Queu'
  +'e.'#13#10#13#10'Works:'#13#10'- store used source files and checksums'#13#10
  +'- store compiler flags'#13#10'- restore module as json'#13#10'- restore typ'
  +'es'#13#10'- references to built in symbols via Id'#13#10'- references to mo'
