  +'inue reading'#13#10'- WPO uses Proc.References'#13#10'- gzipped json'#13#10
  +'- write final switches'#13#10#13#10'ToDo:'#13#10'- store used GUIDs'#13#10
  +'- distinguish reader errors in fatal and error'#13#10'- when pcu is bad, un'
  +'load and use src'#13#10'- replace GUID with crc'#13#10'- srcmaps for precom'
  +'piled js'#13#10'}'#13#10'unit Pas2JsFiler;'#13#10#13#10'{$mode objfpc}{$H+}'
