  +#10'In the windows desktop environment.....'#13#10'if the CEF4 Chromium embe'
  +'dded widget tools are installed, then in the Windows environment, an IFrame'
  +#13#10'will be created as an embedded Chromium browser.  (compiler directive'
  +' ''-dChromium'' is set).'#13#10'If CEF4 is not available, a TXIFrame will b'
  +'e displayed by launching a separate browser page for each IFrame.'#13#10'Th'
  +'e project runtime then loosely communicates with the resulting browser page'
  +' by running a polling timer which'#13#10'finds and fetches the titles of op'
  +'ened windows.'#13#10#13#10'In the JS/browser environment.....'#13#10'This c'
  +'reates an HTML element of type iframe.'#13#10'postMessage is then used to c'
  +'ommunicate between the parent window and the iframe.'#13#10'*)'#13#10#13#10
